      "sourceText": "平面运动时，云台和底盘仅水平朝向不同，z轴方向相同；绕 z 的角速度分量不因水平 yaw 换轴而改变，所以源码只旋转 `vx、vy`，对 `wz` 直接相加。此处没有求导云台 yaw，也没有把云台相对转速作为底盘转速输入。底盘整体转向与 `gimbal_yaw_joint` 的机械相对转动必须分开理解，不能根据话题参考系名称混为同一个动作。",
      "translatedText": "In planar motion, the gimbal and chassis differ only in horizontal orientation, with the same z\\-axis direction; the angular velocity component about z does not change due to horizontal yaw axis switching, so the source code only rotates `vx、vy` and directly adds `wz`\\. Here, the gimbal yaw is not differentiated, nor is the gimbal relative rotation speed used as the chassis rotation speed input\\. The overall chassis steering and the mechanical relative rotation of `gimbal_yaw_joint` must be understood separately and cannot be conflated into the same action based on topic reference frame names\\.",
